# Line-ending policy.
#
# Most of the repo follows the platform default (core.autocrlf). The
# paths below are *committed data / source artifacts* whose bytes must be
# identical on every checkout: the Phase 6 dataset and benchmark JSONL,
# their manifests, the controlled COBOL source corpus, and the training
# configs. `app/training/dataset.py::dataset_manifest_hash` hashes
# `data/dataset/<v>/all.jsonl` byte-for-byte, so a CRLF checkout on
# Windows must not change that hash. `eol=lf` forces LF in the working
# tree regardless of core.autocrlf.

data/**/*.jsonl        text eol=lf
data/**/*.json         text eol=lf
data/**/*.cbl          text eol=lf
data/**/*.md           text eol=lf

configs/training/*.yaml text eol=lf
